    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"going somewhere different\" isn't an option. i've tried everything. the spark is just gone. i look at my old work and it's like looking at a ghost of someone i actually respected. now, i'm just a person who used to be good. i'd rather just stop everything now while i still have some dignity left, rather than live to see myself become a complete joke of a person. it feels better to just... end the story while it's still decent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
